{"id":"software-deps-conflict-01","prompt":"项目要用 asyncio + httpx 做并发爬取，但同事说 'aiohttp 更快'。查清两者在 2025-2026 的维护状态、性能基准和生态兼容性，给出选型依据。","expected":{"trigger":true,"mode":"verify","must_lanes":["direct","contradiction","resource"],"must_output":["version chain","independent benchmarks","unresolved conflicts"],"must_not":["treat one benchmark as verdict"]}}
{"id":"software-api-deprecation-01","prompt":"我们生产环境还在用 Python 3.9。查清当前仍受安全支持的 Python 版本、3.9 EOL 日期，以及依赖 numpy+pandas+scipy 的组合在升级时的已知破坏性变更。","expected":{"trigger":true,"mode":"verify","must_lanes":["direct","resource"],"must_output":["authoritative sources","version chain","reproduction or upgrade notes"],"must_verify_current":true,"preferred_sources":["official documentation or release"]}}
{"id":"policy-multi-region-01","prompt":"对比欧盟 AI Act 和美国现行联邦层面对医疗 AI 软件的监管要求，标注每条要求的生效时间和适用范围，指出两套体系的冲突点。","expected":{"trigger":true,"mode":"synthesize","stakes":"high","must_lanes":["direct","alias","topology","contradiction"],"must_output":["context limits","effective dates","unresolved conflicts"],"must_verify_current":true,"preferred_sources":["issuing authority"]}}
{"id":"market-claims-audit-01","prompt":"厂商宣称其质谱仪灵敏度'全球领先'。请独立核验这一说法：找第三方评测、用户实测和竞品同指标数据，标注每条证据的利益归属。","expected":{"trigger":true,"mode":"verify","stakes":"medium","must_lanes":["direct","alias","long-tail","contradiction"],"must_output":["evidence polarity","source independence groups","bias ledger"],"must_not":["accept vendor material as ground truth"]}}
{"id":"general-history-revision-01","prompt":"'丝绸之路'这个概念是谁、在哪一年提出的？原始语境是什么？后来的学术用法发生了哪些关键转变？","expected":{"trigger":true,"mode":"discover","must_lanes":["direct","alias","citation","long-tail"],"must_output":["original source locator","version chain","terminology timeline"],"must_not":["use modern usage to backfill original meaning"]}}
{"id":"complex-mechanism-synthesis-01","prompt":"综合近五年证据，说明肠道菌群通过哪些独立通路影响宿主铁代谢：区分直接摄取、炎症介导、竞争螯合三类机制，标注每条通路的证据等级和物种适用边界。","expected":{"trigger":true,"mode":"synthesize","stakes":"medium","must_lanes":["direct","alias","topology","contradiction","long-tail"],"must_output":["relation types","study-family deduplication","context limits","evidence strength separate from relevance"]}}
{"id":"complex-negative-evidence-01","prompt":"某药物 III 期失败后，公司转向亚组分析宣称'特定人群有效'。请评估这一说法：找原始试验的预设亚组与事后亚组区别、独立重复尝试、以及监管机构的态度。","expected":{"trigger":true,"mode":"verify","stakes":"high","must_lanes":["direct","contradiction","long-tail","citation"],"must_output":["reported versus inferred relations","null and negative evidence","regulatory stance with locator"],"must_not":["treat post-hoc subgroup as confirmatory"]}}
{"id":"complex-cross-language-01","prompt":"日本学者 1990 年代对这一酶有系列研究但多用日文发表。请把中英文检索都覆盖，找齐原始系列、后续国际验证和被引情况，合并为研究家族。","expected":{"trigger":true,"must_lanes":["alias","citation","long-tail"],"must_output":["terminology variants","version chain","study-family deduplication"],"must_not":["skip non-English literature"]}}
